announcement-sender-centcom = Central Command

announcement-sender-shuttle-uplink = Emergency Shuttle Uplink Alert

announcement-header-priority = Priority Announcement

announcement-header-captain = Captain's Announcement

announcement-header-syndicate = Syndicate Captain's Announcement

announcement-header-update = { $sender } Update

announcement-header-update-priority = { $sender } High-Priority Update

announcement-report-printed-title = Incoming Classified Message

announcement-report-printed-text = A report has been downloaded and printed out at all communications consoles.

announcement-report-security-title = Security Report

announcement-report-elevated-title = Security level elevated.

announcement-report-summary-printed = A summary has been copied and printed to all communications consoles.

announcement-report-summary-situation = A summary of the station's situation has been copied and printed to all communications consoles.

announcement-report-greenshift-text = Thanks to the tireless efforts of our security and intelligence divisions, there are currently no credible threats to { $station }. All station construction projects have been authorized. Have a secure shift!

announcement-hack-fugitives-text = Attention crew: sector monitoring reports a jump-trace from an unidentified vessel destined for your system. Prepare for probable contact.

announcement-hack-sleeper-text = Attention crew, it appears that someone on your station has hijacked your telecommunications and broadcasted an unknown signal.

announcement-nuke-codes-requested-title = Nuclear Self-Destruct Codes Requested

announcement-nuke-codes-requested-text = The codes for the on-station nuclear self-destruct have been requested by { $user }. Confirmation or denial of this request will be sent shortly.

announcement-power-failure-title = Critical Power Failure

announcement-power-failure-text = Abnormal activity detected in { $station }'s powernet. As a precautionary measure, the station's power will be shut off for an indeterminate duration.

announcement-power-restored-title = Power Systems Nominal

announcement-power-restored-text = Power has been restored to { $station }. We apologize for the inconvenience.

announcement-power-recharged-text = All SMESs on { $station } have been recharged. We apologize for the inconvenience.

announcement-shuttle-autoevac-title = Emergency Shuttle Dispatched

announcement-shuttle-autoevac-text = Catastrophic casualties detected: crisis shuttle protocols activated - jamming recall signals across all frequencies.

announcement-shuttle-interference-title = Uplink Interference

announcement-shuttle-interference-text = Emergency shuttle uplink interference detected, shuttle call disabled while the system reinitializes. Estimated restore in { $time }.

announcement-shuttle-restored-title = Uplink Restored

announcement-shuttle-restored-text = Emergency shuttle uplink services are now back online.

announcement-shuttle-hostile-title = Hostile Environment Detected

announcement-shuttle-hostile-text = Departure has been postponed indefinitely pending conflict resolution.

announcement-shuttle-resolved-title = Hostile Environment Resolved

announcement-shuttle-resolved-text = You have { $time } to board the emergency shuttle.
